⚡🇺🇸🇺🇦 Trump has refused Zelensky’s request for 300 Patriot interceptor missiles ahead of winter, according to The Atlantic. Zelensky warned that without the missiles, Ukraine may be unable to protect its energy grid from winter strikes, risking widespread blackouts and heating failures.

Following the refusal, Ukraine’s representatives proposed an alternative — requesting permission to use Starlink to target ballistic missile launchers on Russian territory.

